    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59701" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρᾰτερό-φρων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
